WEBVTT

00:11:01.081 --> 00:11:02.901
weaker,

00:11:02.925 --> 00:11:06.737
by extension, less trustworthy,

00:11:07.371 --> 00:11:08.739
less valuable

00:11:09.652 --> 00:11:11.441
and ultimately,

00:11:11.465 --> 00:11:13.010
less human.

00:11:14.448 --> 00:11:18.665
And domestic workers know
it's a slippery slope

00:11:18.689 --> 00:11:25.339
when we start to see a worker
as less than a real worker,

00:11:26.318 --> 00:11:29.644
to a woman as less than a woman,